  Slug: street-preacher
  DisplayName: Street Preacher
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Forget the church orthodoxy and the stuffy cloisters-spreading the
    word of your god to the people is your calling. You've preached on the street
    corners and in public houses, to wanderers on the road and to captives in the
    stocks. Adventuring can take you across the world. What vocation could better
    serve to take your holy words to fresh ears? Choose two attribute boosts. One
    must be to Wisdom or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Religion skill and the Lore skill for your patron deity. You gain the
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dubious Knowledge] skill feat.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Secrets of Magic
